    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> defined by <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is a surjective function, then <math><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to",
